Exploiting a gap in your target's defenses, you make a lethal strike with your offhand weapon for [256%, 287%, 311%, 332%, 350% (TL1-5)] damage that causes them to drop their weapon, disarming them for [2, 4, 5, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] turns.

Tempo will reduce the cooldown of this talent by 1 turn each time it is triggered defensively.

The chance to disarm increases with your Accuracy.
